## Data Sources and Attribution

### Stars (stars.json, stars_bright.json, stars_medium.json, stars_all.json)

**HYG Database v4.1**
- Author: David Nash (astronexus)
- License: CC BY-SA 4.0
- Source: https://github.com/astronexus/HYG-Database
- Description: Compilation of Hipparcos, Yale Bright Star, and Gliese catalogs

### Deep Sky Objects (deep_sky_objects.json)

**OpenNGC**
- Author: Mattia Verga
- License: CC BY-SA 4.0
- Source: https://github.com/mattiaverga/OpenNGC
- Description: NGC/IC objects database compiled from NED, HyperLEDA, SIMBAD

### Constellation Lines (constellations.json)

**Stellarium / IAU Constellation Data**
- Source: https://github.com/Stellarium/stellarium
- License: GPL v2+ (constellation line data used with attribution)

### Named Objects (named_objects.json)

Derived from HYG Database - CC BY-SA 4.0
